Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 23:11:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add BIA DATACENTER branding and server configuration
 features

- Integrate BIA DATACENTER logo (PNG and ICO) replacing default assets
- Add server configuration UI with editable IP, hostname, port, auth backend
- Implement Windows hosts file auto-update for hostname entries
- Add 'Settings' button in login screen for server configuration
- Create default INI configuration pointing to 10.10.10.50:8006
- Add PyInstaller build scripts (Python and batch) for Windows .exe generation
- Update requirements to include Pillow for image handling
- Store user server configuration in %APPDATA%/VDIClient/server_config.json

